menu "Blink Configuration"

    config BLINK_GPIO
        int "WS2812 data GPIO number"
        range 0 48
        default 8
        help
            GPIO number (IOxx) connected to the WS2812 (NeoPixel) data line.

            Many ESP32-C3/S3 DevKit boards have an on-board WS2812 on GPIO8.
            Classic ESP32 DevKits without an addressable LED can use any
            free GPIO with an external WS2812.

    config BLINK_LED_COUNT
        int "Number of WS2812 LEDs"
        range 1 256
        default 1
        help
            Number of WS2812 LEDs in the strip / ring connected to BLINK_GPIO.

    config BLINK_PERIOD_MS
        int "Blink period in milliseconds"
        range 10 10000
        default 1000
        help
            How long the LED stays on (and off) for each blink cycle, in ms.

endmenu
